```mdl
verdict F-1.3: The composed outliner does not seed an empty document; seeding exists only behind editor(true).
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/editor.ts#editor, github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/outliner.ts#outliner]
  note: |
    `initialize(autoInsert)` inserts `- [ ] ` and places the caret only when `autoInsert` is true, and `outliner()` calls
    `editor()` with the default `false`. An empty document instead shows the ghost add button on its blank line
    (F-2.6). The only related test checks that an empty document has a tree.
```

