```mdl
verdict F-2.4: Top-level lists are islands, prose belongs to no item, the caret rests in prose, prose is flush and the menu hides on it.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/tree.ts#outlinerTree, github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/editor.ts#editor, github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/outliner.ts#outliner, github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/menu.ts#menu]
