  walkthrough:
    - The parser makes each top-level list its own island and leaves prose out of every item. github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/tree.ts#outlinerTree
    - The filter lets the caret rest where no item is found. github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/editor.ts#editor
    - The decorations give prose lines the flush cm-outline-prose class. github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/outliner.ts#outliner
    - The menu trigger hides when the caret has no item. github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/ui-editor/src/extensions/structure/outliner/menu.ts#menu
  note: The flush styling and the hidden menu are not tested; the tree and caret parts are.
```

